# Persistence & Platform

## Storage

All via `ContactStorageService` + `SharedPreferences`. Manual `toJson`/`fromJson` on `StoredContact` in `models.dart`.

| Key | Purpose |
|-----|---------|
| `stored_contacts` | Contact list JSON |
| `favorite_contacts` | Favorite names |
| `vibrations_enabled`, `hud_visible` | Settings toggles |
| `scroll_pos_*` | Pane scroll indices |
| `self_contact_name`, `self_contact_color` | Self-contact identity |
| `pending_self_contact_pick` | iOS post-import prompt flag |
| `is_pro_unlocked` | In `ProSubscriptionService` |

Add new prefs as methods on `ContactStorageService`, not ad-hoc `SharedPreferences` calls in screens.

## Platform splits

```dart
import 'dart:io' show Platform;

if (Platform.isAndroid) {
  // Auto-detect profile via FlutterContacts.profile
} else if (Platform.isIOS) {
  // Manual self-contact pick; set pending_self_contact_pick
}
```

Self-contact matching: `SelfContactFinder` (by color, phone, or name).

## Color/match changes

Route through `PhoneUtils` → `ColorUtils` → `MatchCalculator`. Do not inline hue math in widgets.

## Permissions

Use `ensureContactsReadPermission()` from `contacts_permission.dart` before device picker/import.
